WEBVTT

00:00:02.756 --> 00:00:06.681
Start in Pantry. Check what you already have before shopping.

00:00:06.681 --> 00:00:10.479
Open an item to review its amount or mark it running low.

00:00:10.479 --> 00:00:12.825
Your pantry reflects what you record.

00:00:12.825 --> 00:00:15.154
Open Shopping and add what is missing.

00:00:15.154 --> 00:00:18.738
Enter the item name, then an amount or store if useful.

00:00:18.738 --> 00:00:22.151
This is your shopping list, not extra pantry stock yet.

00:00:22.151 --> 00:00:25.394
After buying, open Expenses and scan the receipt.

00:00:25.394 --> 00:00:28.587
Use a clear photo with all item lines and the total.

00:00:28.587 --> 00:00:32.256
The scan is a draft. Nothing is saved just by scanning.

00:00:32.256 --> 00:00:35.840
Review the store, purchase date, total and currency.

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:38.870
Keep Record in Expenses selected if you want the receipt recorded

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:43.041
there. Correct mistakes against the original receipt before saving.

00:00:43.041 --> 00:00:47.436
Choose Add all for eligible items, or tap individual cards.

00:00:47.436 --> 00:00:49.271
Select food you keep at home.

00:00:49.271 --> 00:00:52.911
Leave meals eaten out, gifts and services unselected.

00:00:52.911 --> 00:00:54.959
Check each selected quantity.

00:00:54.959 --> 00:00:57.903
Open Quantity and matches for each receipt item.

00:00:57.903 --> 00:01:00.079
Review its Shopping item selection.

00:01:00.079 --> 00:01:03.066
Choose the matching pending item when appropriate, or save it

00:01:03.066 --> 00:01:06.749
as a new bought item. Review the final choices, then save and

00:01:06.749 --> 00:01:10.546
update pantry. If you already recorded this purchase, link the

00:01:10.546 --> 00:01:12.722
recent matching purchase when offered.

00:01:12.722 --> 00:01:15.553
That keeps its pantry amount from being added twice.

00:01:15.553 --> 00:01:19.052
Now check Expenses for spending, Shopping for the bought items,

00:01:19.052 --> 00:01:21.313
and Pantry for selected stock.

00:01:21.313 --> 00:01:24.641
Saving an expense alone does not add pantry items.

00:01:24.641 --> 00:01:26.797
You choose those updates during review.
